            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%28n%2C1%29-category"} categories
            are widely studied.
          %p
            For low values of
            = succeed "," do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
